00:07:34.000 --> 00:08:05.000
or upper-middle-class boys. For some reason, our girls are showing problems in multiple domains. So it's not just the depression, the anxiety, the typically female problems, but also the more typically male problems of drug and alcohol use and rule breaking. It's very troubling. How can parents teach their kids to have this balanced value system? And my answer almost invariably is, you know what, we really can't teach what we have to do as model. So I can tell my kids tell the cows come home, listen, be a good person.

